+++ b/changelog/7220.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fixed the paths shown in tracebacks being relative to the current working
+directory instead of the directory from which pytest was invoked, which caused
+incorrect paths when a test changed the working directory.
